WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Real local game: pink swarms expand under seven operator-chosen gambits.
The blue house opponent uses fixed rules, not an AI model.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.500
Automated human-side controls select swarm 1 and issue a nearby order.
The white ring marks selection; the HUD says “by hand”.

00:16.500 --> 00:24.000
The automated G key returns swarm 1 to the gambits.
The green status says “swarm #1 back on gambits”.

00:24.000 --> 00:40.000
Swarms continue to move and capture planets. Pink is the local side;
blue is the house. The opening was chosen once; no model runs in the clip.
